--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data licence
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
The code in this repository is MIT-licensed as above. The data files under
`data/` contain *extracted facts* (numbers, experimental conditions and
bibliographic metadata) transcribed from published papers. Facts are not
copyrightable expression; each data row records the originating paper
(`Ref_ID`, `DOI`) so that it can be cited. If you reuse the data, cite the
original sources listed in `data/sources.csv`, not only this repository.
